## Rules

- Validate at the boundary with {{validation_tool}} <!-- GEN: e.g. Pydantic request schemas, zod schemas -->: types, required fields, allow-lists, length/size limits.
- Reject invalid input with the workspace's error contract; never "clean up" input silently.
- Data from external providers ({{providers}}) and from queues is untrusted too.
- Never trust client-side validation alone; it is UX.

